      "writtenOn": "2026-11-26T06:52:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for highlighting the compatibility concern. This changes only the string representation for CRCs with leading zeros; the numeric CRC remains unchanged. Exact string comparisons could be affected, and I have not confirmed whether all existing consumers accept both forms. I will document this consideration in the commit message.\n\nI also verified the case without leading zeros using a hardware read:\nRaw bytes:       9C 06 30 88\nCurrent output:  8830069C\nProposed output: 8830069C\n\nThe output remains unchanged in this case.",
